{
  "Package": "AMOUNTAIN",
  "Type": "Package",
  "Title": "Active modules for multilayer weighted gene co-expression\nnetworks: a continuous optimization approach",
  "Version": "1.37.0",
  "Date": "2016-11-12",
  "Author": "Dong Li, Shan He, Zhisong Pan and Guyu Hu",
  "Maintainer": "Dong Li <dxl466@cs.bham.ac.uk>",
  "Description": "A pure data-driven gene network, weighted gene\nco-expression network (WGCN) could be constructed only from\nexpression profile. Different layers in such networks may\nrepresent different time points, multiple conditions or various\nspecies. AMOUNTAIN aims to search active modules in multi-layer\nWGCN using a continuous optimization approach.",
